# Added to the Arch live ISO package list (releng) for the GUI installer.
# The live desktop: a small ZeXOS desktop (niri + Noctalia, the same keys
# as the installed system) with Calamares on top. Only what the live
# session needs; the full app set comes with the install.
niri
xwayland-satellite
noctalia-zexos
bibata-cursor-zexos
kitty
fish
fastfetch
# Apps behind the main keys, so the live desktop is usable before
# installing: Mod+B browser, Mod+E files, Mod+W wallpaper picker.
firefox
dolphin
roller
polkit-kde-agent
xdg-utils
networkmanager
pipewire
pipewire-pulse
wireplumber
brightnessctl
python-pillow
zexos-calamares
qt6-wayland
qt6ct-kde
mpvpaper
socat
ffmpeg
qt6-imageformats
breeze-icons
noto-fonts
noto-fonts-emoji
ttf-jetbrains-mono-nerd
ttf-nunito
mesa
vulkan-swrast
git
